{"id":"82a3c01529a680bd","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ladner.md","title":"thm-ladner (Ladner Theorem)","display":"thm-ladner (Ladner Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-np-intermediate]]"],"display":"thm-ladner (Ladner Theorem)","label":"28-thm-ladner","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-ladner","Ladner Theorem","Existence of NP-intermediate languages"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f80881be5f44d233\" href=\"?note=f80881be5f44d233\" title=\"28-df-np-intermediate\">28-df-np-intermediate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ladner (Ladner Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ladner"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ladner</span><span>Ladner Theorem</span><span>Existence of NP-intermediate languages</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPI}=\\mathbf{NP}\\setminus(\\mathbf P\\cup\\mathrm{NPComplete})\">\\(\\mathbf{NPI}=\\mathbf{NP}\\setminus(\\mathbf P\\cup\\mathrm{NPComplete})\\)</span> 见本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{NPI}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{NPI}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书构造根据自身求解难度缓慢变化的填充指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>，语言为经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{H(n)}\">\\(n^{H(n)}\\)</span> 填充的 SAT。若该语言在 P，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 有界，填充只是多项式，迫使 SAT 在 P；若该语言 NP 完全，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 趋于无穷，任一多项式归约的输出只能承载显著更小的原公式，从而递归求 SAT 得到多项式算法。两种情况均与前提矛盾。原书及提示展开延迟对角化，部分有效计算和缩短递归的细节留作习题3.6；本次核对该结构，未声称已形式化完整构造。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理3.3及习题3.6提示；印刷71–72、532页；PDF97–98、558页。条件及延迟填充证明结构已核对。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：延迟对角化的有效计算及缩短递归仍需完成习题3.6。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-intermediate","status":"resolved","id":"f80881be5f44d233","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-intermediate]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPI}=\\mathbf{NP}\\setminus(\\mathbf P\\cup\\mathrm{NPComplete})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{NPI}\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"n^{H(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":1533,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"NP 中间问题：[[28-df-np-intermediate]]、[[28-thm-ladner]]。"}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","7a9125ebbfdef91e","f80881be5f44d233"]}